{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Can you explain how\na sewing machine works?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3540,
    "dDurationMs": 1599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, think about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5139,
    "dDurationMs": 997,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've all seen them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6136,
    "dDurationMs": 1323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's that little\nneedle that's moving up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7459,
    "dDurationMs": 1031,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and down really fast, leaving a trail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8490,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of stitches behind them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10590,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you think about it for a second,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12510,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how are they doing it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13980,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the needle is\nnever actually going fully"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16050,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through the fabric."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16883,
    "dDurationMs": 2137,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you're hand sewing, you have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19020,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to pass the needle up and down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21900,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to let go of the needle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23040,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and grab onto it on the other side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25650,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in order to invent the\nsewing machine, we first had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28530,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to invent a whole new way of sewing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31950,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's one of these things that\nalmost no one thinks about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33930,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but is so important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35280,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every piece of clothing you've ever put"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36930,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on virtually was made by a sewing machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40140,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in this video, I'm going to explain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41790,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how sewing machines work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43020,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I promise when you\nfind out, you will find it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45090,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so incredibly satisfying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47400,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what you'll realize is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48810,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that these machines are performing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50700,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tiny mechanical miracles every second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54960,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A part of this video was brought to you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56190,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by KiwiCo, more about them\nat the end of the show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59520,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The foot pedal is right\nin front of your right foot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62910,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can gently rest it. It\ndoesn't need a lot of pressure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66240,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So easy does it, and you\nshould be able to start going."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69240,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- All right. Ah, all right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74675,
    "dDurationMs": 835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sewing machine rumbling)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75510,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77340,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Noah] I find it meditative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82740,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If I were going to sew two pieces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84450,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of fabric together, this\nis how I would do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87900,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Weaving the needle back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90150,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and forth through both pieces of fabric."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94410,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is known as a running stitch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96960,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there are more sophisticated\nstitches you could do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100230,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you're trying to mechanize\nany hand stitch, you run"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103800,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into a major problem, which is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105660,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that any time you pass the needle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107700,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through the fabric, you have\nto release it on one side"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110310,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and pick it up again on the other side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112620,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is almost impossible\nfor a machine to do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115440,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least a machine from 200 years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118260,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in order to invent the\nsewing machine, we first needed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121890,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to come up with a totally\nnew way of sewing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124860,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this came in three breakthroughs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127821,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131550,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Human have been sewing clothes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133110,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for tens of thousands of years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135690,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2016, researchers found a\nneedle in a cave in Siberia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138990,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that dates back to about 50,000 years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143100,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The crazy thing is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144060,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that homo sapiens didn't\nlive in that cave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147390,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was inhabited by the\nDenisovans, a now extinct species"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151650,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of early humans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153600,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So sewing isn't just a homo sapien thing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156540,
    "dDurationMs": 1623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is a human thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162330,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The needle is made of bone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163860,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in other regards, it\nlooks like any modern needle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166590,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a sharp end pierced through fabric"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168690,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and an eye on the other\nend for the thread."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171660,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Needles have remained basically unchanged"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174000,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for tens of thousands of years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176130,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Artifacts from caves in\nFrance, ancient Egypt, Greece,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179790,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "India, China, and Japan,\nall look about the same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184440,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is until 1755."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188130,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Charles Frederick Wiesenthal was a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189960,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "German inventor living in England."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191940,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're not exactly sure what motivated him,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194460,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some believe he was trying\nto invent a sewing machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197580,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but maybe he was just tired"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198870,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of flipping the needle\nover twice every stitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201600,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what he created was\na needle that was sharp"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203820,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on both sides, so you\ncould pass the needle back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206760,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and forth through the fabric\nwithout flipping it over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210060,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He patented his invention, a\nneedle for ornamenting fabrics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213630,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which may have sped up sewing a little."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215760,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the two-sided needle\ndelivered an unexpected benefit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219060,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "used by all sewing\nmachines up until this day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222630,
    "dDurationMs": 3423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It moved the eye of the\nneedle next to the sharp tip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227550,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how does that help?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229590,
    "dDurationMs": 1683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I put the needle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231273,
    "dDurationMs": 3447,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into the fabric, the thread\ndoes go below the fabric,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234720,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but when I pull it out, the\nthread also gets pulled out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237600,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it seems like we've achieved nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240150,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need to find a way to tangle the thread"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242790,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when it's at the bottom of the stitch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245100,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to stop it from pulling out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247140,
    "dDurationMs": 3328,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And luckily, there are\ntwo ways of doing this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250468,
    "dDurationMs": 2282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252750,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you can keep a loop of\nthread underneath the fabric,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256320,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as I pull the needle out, well\nthen, I can move the fabric"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259590,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over and pass that needle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261570,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through the loop, forming a little link."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266370,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if I do that again, I can form a chain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270510,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of these stitches."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272250,
    "dDurationMs": 3573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is why this is\nknown as a chain stitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276750,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The chain stitch was one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277890,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the first stitches\nsuccessfully performed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280200,
    "dDurationMs": 1323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by sewing machines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283440,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's really hard to say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284670,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who invented the first sewing machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286380,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were just so many people working"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287970,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the problem at the same time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289830,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there are many competing claims."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292320,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1790, Thomas Saint drew\ndetailed patent drawings"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296040,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a sewing machine design,\nbut there is no evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298740,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that he ever built a prototype."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300630,
    "dDurationMs": 3885,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1814, Joseph Madersperger\nwas granted a patent in Vienna."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304515,
    "dDurationMs": 2565,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It took him a decade to build the machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307080,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but he never commercialized it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308880,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He spent the rest of his life\ntrying to perfect the design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312510,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1830, Frenchman Barthélemy Thimonnier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315330,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "built his own version."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316740,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It created a chain stitch\nwith a barb needle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319500,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was granted a patent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320580,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and set up a garment factory\nwith 80 of his machines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323970,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There, they began manufacturing uniforms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326010,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the French army but this\ninvention caused an uproar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329730,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A mob of 200 angry tailors\nransacked his factory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333510,
    "dDurationMs": 2553,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and destroyed all of his machines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339180,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It took a few more decades"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340320,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before sewing machines\nwere reliable enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342060,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be commercially viable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343470,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The two most reliable ways"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344970,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to build a chain stitch\nmachine were invented"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347160,
    "dDurationMs": 3149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at nearly the same time\nin 1857, when James Gibbs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350309,
    "dDurationMs": 3784,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Charles Raymond received\ntheir respective patents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354960,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was easy enough for me\nto grab the loop of thread"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357390,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the model, but it's much more difficult"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359850,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to design a machine to do\nthis reliably and repeatedly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363780,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Charles Raymond's design used a hook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366540,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The needle punctures the fabric"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368070,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and carries the thread down with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370440,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then as the needle moves up,\nthe thread between the eye"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373530,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the fabric shortens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374850,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and buckles forming a\nlittle bulge of thread."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378390,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At exactly this instant, the\nsharp hook catches the bulge,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381300,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stretching it into a loop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383340,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as the needle comes back\ndown, the hook moves backwards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387210,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the needle passes through the loop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389520,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The needle comes all the way down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391380,
    "dDurationMs": 2637,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then as it moves back up,\nthe thread between the eye"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394017,
    "dDurationMs": 1893,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the fabric buckles again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395910,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the hook catches this\nbulge pulling the thread"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398310,
    "dDurationMs": 2943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into a loop for the needle\nto pass through once more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405900,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Gibbs had a similar design,\nbut the hook was rotating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409710,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as the needle lowers\nthe hook grabs the thread,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413100,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rotating hook spins around,\nthe first loop is released,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417090,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then the hook grabs the second loop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419940,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It took Gibbs thirty-seven\nprototypes, all carved outta wood"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423660,
    "dDurationMs": 2999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get this incredible\nlooper shape just right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426659,
    "dDurationMs": 2641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then that same shape was used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429300,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on over 80 models of sewing\nmachines for 80 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433500,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The looper was held by pieces\nof metal tightly enough"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436560,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it didn't fall out,\nbut with enough of a gap"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438870,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the thread to pass\nthrough all the way around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441690,
    "dDurationMs": 2823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are showing a simplified\nmodel here for clarity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445440,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's a flaw with this simple way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447150,
    "dDurationMs": 1383,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of making a chain stitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449970,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the thread comes\nloose, you can easily pull"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452340,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out all the stitching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453870,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's remarkable how quickly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455100,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and easily the thread gets pulled out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456810,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because there's barely any\nfriction with the fabric."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 460560,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only friction holding each\nstitch in place is the loop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464190,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the previous stitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466440,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So once one goes, they\njust all go in a chain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469860,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So people developed more\ncomplex chain stitches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472320,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that use more thread and are more robust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474960,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'll likely find chain\nstitches holding the hem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477240,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your jeans together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478830,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can also embroider beautiful patterns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481140,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the chain stitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482880,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Anything that kind of\nhad decorative stitches is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485340,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what it was originally used\nfor, but then it became used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487860,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for all kind of lettering and flowers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491370,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You're sort of doing\ngymnastics figuring out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493410,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if I feel it this direction,\nwhere is my next path gonna be?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496110,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're trying to kind of\nthink ahead of yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497910,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think as you become more\nskilled with the chains too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500820,
    "dDurationMs": 3139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's where your work begins\nto look a lot more refined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503959,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sewing machine rumbling)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510480,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Besides the chain stitch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511740,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is a completely different\nway to secure the thread."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515310,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And honestly, it's kind of genius."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517410,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All it requires is two\nseparate spools of thread."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521910,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now this spool of thread\nis called the bobbin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524760,
    "dDurationMs": 1623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here's how it works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527480,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The needle goes through two pieces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529470,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of fabric all the way down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532860,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you pass the second\nspool of thread completely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538950,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through a loop in the top spool,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543270,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then bring the needle\nback up, pull in the excess"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550050,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what we have done is interlocked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553560,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these two pieces of thread."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555720,
    "dDurationMs": 3093,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why this is known as a lock stitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561443,
    "dDurationMs": 2297,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1846, Elias Howe patented it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563740,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to promote his new creation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565800,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he staged a live sewing demonstration, him"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568830,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and his sewing machine\nversus five seamstresses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571860,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Howe's machine worked,\nbut it wasn't elegant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574560,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The machine used a curved\nneedle, the fabric hung"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577140,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "down vertically, and it\ncould only make stitches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579690,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a straight line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581220,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Five years later, Allen\nB. Wilson dramatically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583920,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "improved the lock stitch sewing machine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585840,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "receiving two patents, one\nin 1850 and one in 1851."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589980,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first patent was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591270,
    "dDurationMs": 2553,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the vibrating shuttle\nlock stitch machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594780,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Although it's called a vibrating shuttle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596820,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it actually oscillates back and forth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599250,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and inside it is a small bobbin of thread."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602400,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As it moves forward, it\ncatches the top thread"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605130,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the needle forming a\nloop and as the shuttle passes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608070,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through this loop, it\ncreates a lock stitch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610080,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by intertwining the top thread\nwith the lower bobbin thread."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616920,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The shuttles movement is synchronized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618840,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the needles up-and-down motion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622080,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The shuttle was pushed around by pieces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623880,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of metal tightly enough\nthat it didn't fall out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626040,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but with enough of a gap for the thread"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627810,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to pass all the way around the shuttle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630360,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This type of sewing machine\nwas incredibly common"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632880,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the late 1800s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634440,
    "dDurationMs": 3381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many millions of just the\nSinger Model 27 were made,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637821,
    "dDurationMs": 2779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they were built incredibly robustly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640600,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are many machines that are now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642630,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over a hundred years old\nthat are still working."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645930,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sewing machines were\ndeveloped before the idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648360,
    "dDurationMs": 2163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of planned obsolescence took off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653040,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second patent that Wilson\nreceived in 1851 is the basis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656760,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for how most modern sewing machines work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659340,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of a shuttle moving\nback and forth, the bobbin is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663300,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inside a rotating hook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665820,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's see how that works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667890,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The needle comes down,\npulling that top thread,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672330,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it goes down really low,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674730,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it pops back up a little bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676740,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "creating this little bulge right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679320,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when the rotating hook\ncomes around, it is grabbed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684438,
    "dDurationMs": 3642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by that rotating hook,\npulling even more thread"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688080,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that this thread can pass\nentirely around the bobbin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692160,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then needle pops back up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696780,
    "dDurationMs": 2319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We pull in the excess"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699099,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we've formed another\nlock stitch like so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704580,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From this, it might look\nlike you're using more thread"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707310,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the top because when\nthis thread comes in, you need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710070,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to pass an entire loop around the bobbin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713400,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that thread then gets pulled back up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715650,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we actually filmed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717000,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in slow motion a sewing\nmachine using a gradient thread"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719880,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you can see just how much\nthread is getting pulled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722340,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in from the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723180,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It looks like a lot, but\nultimately you use the same amount"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726780,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of thread from the top spool\nas from the bottom spool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732510,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tension needs to be identical"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734280,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on both the top and bottom thread"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736170,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the same amount of thread\nis used in each stitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738840,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the tension is off, the\nstitch won't meet perfectly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741630,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the middle of the two fabrics leading"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743220,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a much weaker stitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744990,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is true for both vibrating shuttle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746820,
    "dDurationMs": 2553,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and rotating hook lock stitch machines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750480,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what does result is a lot of friction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753300,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can imagine this piece"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754410,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of thread is getting pulled back down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756720,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and back up a whole bunch\nof times with every stitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760320,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what was developed\nwas actually a groove"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762390,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the sewing needle right here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763950,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to reduce the friction between\nthe thread and the fabric"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767070,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as it has to keep getting pulled down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768690,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to go around the bobbin\nand then get pulled back up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770850,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when it's tensioned again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772380,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This resulted in less fraying\nof both thread and fabric"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775350,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and resulted in a cleaner stitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777240,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Practically all modern sewing\nmachine needles have a groove"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780270,
    "dDurationMs": 1023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on one side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782520,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's still an\nimportant piece missing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784710,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After a stitch has been made,\nhow do you move the fabric?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787720,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790650,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the earliest sewing machines,\nthe fabric would be moved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793170,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by hand after every stitch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795000,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that was obviously slow, inefficient,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797310,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the stitches wouldn't\nhave been identically spaced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800070,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few designs were attempted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801390,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the most successful\none was also invented"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803520,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by Allen B. Wilson."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805620,
    "dDurationMs": 2644,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His idea was a small\npiece of metal, the foot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808264,
    "dDurationMs": 2186,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would press down on the fabric."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810450,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the needle is not in the\nfabric, a small piece of metal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813450,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with grooves in it pushes up from below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 815910,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It grabs the fabric and\nthen moves back a fraction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818430,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of an inch advancing it to\nwhere the next stitch should be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821640,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This design is used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822630,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in practically all sewing machines today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825390,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're called feed dogs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827580,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are some modified versions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829260,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of this idea, like the\nuniversal feed machine used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831780,
    "dDurationMs": 1563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for chain stitch embroidery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834510,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- With these style of machines,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835890,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a handle underneath the machine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839100,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it rotates the entire\nnose of the machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843000,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843960,
    "dDurationMs": 1563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And this presser foot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847170,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that will basically advance\nthe fabric in 360 degrees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851790,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So right now we've got this\nhooked up to a single motor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855360,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but back then these cables\nwent up to the ceiling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859590,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and were all powered by one big generator,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861660,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one big like steam power\nor coal powered generator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865440,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I'm sure the\nfactories were so loud."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869580,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There used to be a pin,\nwe've taken them off just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872340,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'cause we don't need them anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873600,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what you would do is you'd pull down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875670,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it would immediately\nengage the machine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877770,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because this was spinning continuously"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880950,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'cause it was all hooked up by one motor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882990,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like nowadays, when you\nstart a machine, you can kind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885060,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of like feather it a little\nbit, you can start slow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888120,
    "dDurationMs": 2611,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back then, they were going\nlike 10,000 rpm right away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890731,
    "dDurationMs": 1859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] You got to gotta be ready."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892590,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yep. Those women were heroes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895740,
    "dDurationMs": 2643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, unbelievable skill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901080,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The most famous name associated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902670,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with sewing machines is\nthat of Isaac Singer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905010,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Singer did not invent\nthe sewing machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907590,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was a shrewd businessman\nbuying up patents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910350,
    "dDurationMs": 3153,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for various parts and\nbuilding his company on that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914370,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inspired by interchangeable parts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916020,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that he saw in production of firearms,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 918000,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he optimized the production process"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920010,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and his company was able to drop the price"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921570,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of sewing machines from a\nhundred dollars to around $10."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925740,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's just over $300 in 2023 terms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929760,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This lower price meant he\ncould sell the machines"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932160,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to families rather than to corporations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934950,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Singer's business was also one\nof the earliest in the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937680,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to offer an installment payment\nplan, allowing the buyer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940800,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to pay it off over a few months,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942360,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than paying the\nentire cost upfront."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944880,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Singer became one of the largest\ncorporations in the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947820,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the first American\nmultinational company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953310,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before the advent of sewing\nmachines, it would take"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955620,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over 12 hours to sew a single shirt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958530,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It now takes less than 30 minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961410,
    "dDurationMs": 2976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1900, the average American\nfamily spent about 15%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964386,
    "dDurationMs": 2934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of its total income on clothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967320,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2003, it was less than 4%,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970350,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but despite spending\nless, we own more clothes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973830,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2019, the worldwide average number"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975780,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of garments owned was over 130."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979410,
    "dDurationMs": 3603,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each year, a hundred billion\ngarments are produced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983970,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just in the US\nalone, 11.3 million tons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987420,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of clothing ends up in landfill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989970,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's nearly 35 kilograms of\nclothing for every man, woman,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993540,
    "dDurationMs": 3423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and child that is thrown away each year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998130,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But should we blame sewing machines?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002150,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The sewing machine is brilliant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004370,
    "dDurationMs": 3393,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Invented, iterated upon, and\nimproved by dozens of people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008870,
    "dDurationMs": 2343,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They really have revolutionized the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012050,
    "dDurationMs": 3573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All it took was inventing a\ncompletely new way to sew."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023000,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, this part of the\nvideo was brought to you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024620,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by KiwiCo, a company that's\nall about making science"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027440,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and learning about the\nworld fun and engaging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030710,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know that the best way to\nlearn is through interactivity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033620,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I personally got a\nmuch better understanding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035510,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of sewing machines by building models,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037850,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually using a sewing\nmachine, taking it apart"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040280,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and putting it back together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041720,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, KiwiCo have been a\nlongtime sponsor of the channel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044210,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they genuinely\nmake great products."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046520,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, my children love them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1048530,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only are they a great learning tool,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050630,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they're also really fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052580,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the crates arrive at my\ndoorstep, my kids can't wait"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1055490,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to open them and start\nputting the projects together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057950,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This month we built a coin eating robot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060710,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and amidst all the fun they were having,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062450,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there were also lessons in\nelectric circuitry, cams"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065900,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and mechanical linkages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067640,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each crate comes with all\nthe the materials you need,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069890,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "detailed instructions and an explanation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071930,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the science behind the project."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073940,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's so nice that everything is there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075710,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and ready to go, so you don't\nneed to run out to the store"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1078170,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or gather any extra supplies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080000,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can just enjoy quality time playing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082700,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and learning with my kids."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084680,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The crates are designed by experts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086270,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be educational and enjoyable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088070,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they have different\nproduct lines to cater"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090050,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to all age groups down to newborns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092720,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "KiwiCo believes that the best\nway to learn is by doing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095330,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that is definitely a\nphilosophy I can get behind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098300,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So go to kiwico.com/veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100790,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get your first month's crate free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1103490,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This offer is exclusive\nto Veritasium viewers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106790,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and with the holiday season coming up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108170,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is your friendly reminder"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1109670,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that KiwiCo crates also make great gifts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1112130,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So go to kiwico.com/veritasium, subscribe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115250,
